        {
          "text": "Muririmbe, mwa majuru, kuk’ Uhoraho abikoze; wa bgina bg’isi usemerere; ni muturike muririmbe, mwa misozi mwe, nawe kibira, n’igiti cose kirimwo: kuk’ Uhoraho yacunguye Yakobo, kand’ azokwihesha icubahiro muri Isirayeli.",
